/span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span><strong>총계</strong></span></span></td><td><span><span><strong>40,328</strong></span></span></td><td><span><span><strong>100.00%</strong></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p></p></div>", "annotation": "<div><h4>설명서 및 활용가이드 다운로드</h4> 데이터 설명서 다운로드 구축활용가이드 다운로드 <div><p><span>- 민간분야 라벨링 데이터 구성요소</span></p><p></p><table><caption>민간분야 라벨링 데이터 구성요소</caption><thead><tr><th colspan=\"3\"><span><span><strong>구분</strong></span></span></th><th><span><span><strong>속성명</strong></span></span></th><th><span><span><strong>타입</strong></span></span></th><th><span><span><strong>필수여부</strong></span></span></th><th><span><span><strong>설명</strong></span></span></th><th><span><span><strong>범위</strong></span></span></th><th><span><span><strong>비고</strong></span></span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"3\"><span><span>1</span></span></td><td><span><span>dataSet</span></span></td><td><span><span>Object</span></span></td><td><span><span>Y</span></span></td><td><span><span>데이터셋정보</span></span></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"></td><td colspan=\"2\"><span><span>1-1</span></span></td><td><span><span>version</span></span></td><td><span><span>String</span></span></td><td><span><span>Y</span></span></td><td><span><span>데이터셋 버전</span></span></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><span><span>1-2</span></span></td><td><span><span>date</span></span></td><td><span><span>String</span></span></td><td><span><span>Y</span></span></td><td><span><span>녹취된 날짜</span></span></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\"><span><span>2</span></span></td><td><span><span>typeInfo</span></span></td><td><span><span>Object</span></span></td><td><span><span>Y</span></span></td><td><span><span>음원 데이터 상세 정보</span></span></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"5\"></td><td colspan=\"2\"><span><span>2-1</span></span></td><td><span><span>category</span></span></td><td><span><span>String</span></span></td><td><span><span>Y</span